      "content": "<p>If the probability that a randomly chosen 6-digit number formed by using digits 1 and 8 only is a multiple of 21 is p, then 96 p is equal to _______________.</p>",
      "options": [],
      "correct_options": [],
      "explanation": "<p>Total number of numbers from given</p>\n<p>Condition = n(s) = 2<sup>6</sup>.</p>\n<p>Every required number is of the form</p>\n<p>A = 7 . (10<sup>a<sub>1</sub></sup> + 10<sup>a<sub>2</sub></sup> + 10<sup>a<sub>3</sub></sup> + .......) + 111111</p>\n<p>Here 111111 is always divisible by 21.</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.509ex\" height=\"1.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -471 667 553\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2234\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2234\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> If A is divisible by 21 then</p>\n<p>10<sup>a<sub>1</sub></sup> + 10<sup>a<sub>2</sub></sup> + 10<sup>a<sub>3</sub></sup> + ....... must be divisible by 3.</p>\n<p>For this we have <sup>6</sup>C<sub>0</sub> + <sup>6</sup>C<sub>3</sub> + <sup>6</sup>C<sub>6</sub> cases are there</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.509ex\" height=\"1.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -471 667 553\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2234\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2234\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> n(E) = <sup>6</sup>C<sub>0</sub> + <sup>6</sup>C<sub>3</sub> + <sup>6</sup>C<sub>6</sub> = 22</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.509ex\" height=\"1.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -471 667 553